  {props.selectedCategory==="gathering"&&<section className="rounded border p-3 space-y-2" style={panel}><div className="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><h3 className="text-sm font-semibold">Gathering geometric standards</h3><button type="button" className="rounded border px-2 py-1 text-xs" style={button()} onClick={()=>setGatheringAngles({...DEFAULT_GATHERING_ANGLES})}>Reset gathering standards</button></div><p className="text-xs">Z is up. Yaw rotates around Z; X and Y control tilt. Each letter rotates about its original local origin using XYZ Euler order before moving to its world position. Z position sets its level independently. Original letter identities and axis proportions are preserved.</p><p className="text-xs">Architectural Elements groups surfaces by orientation. The Void view shows a protected opening when available, or an approximate central profile otherwise.</p><div className="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2">{([['xMin','X tilt minimum'],['xMax','X tilt maximum'],['yMin','Y tilt minimum'],['yMax','Y tilt maximum'],['zMin','Z yaw minimum'],['zMax','Z yaw maximum']] as const).map(([key,label])=>{const bounds=gatheringInputBounds(key,gatheringAngles,gatheringStops);return <label key={key} className="text-xs">{label} (°)<input className="block w-full rounded border p-1" style={style} type="number" min={bounds.min} max={bounds.max} step={15} value={gatheringAngles[key]} onChange={e=>{const value=e.currentTarget.valueAsNumber;if(Number.isFinite(value))setGatheringAngles(previous=>{const allowed=gatheringInputBounds(key,previous,gatheringStops);return {...previous,[key]:Math.max(allowed.min,Math.min(allowed.max,Math.round(value/15)*15))};});}}/></label>})}</div>{(gatheringAngles.xMin>gatheringAngles.xMax||gatheringAngles.yMin>gatheringAngles.yMax||gatheringAngles.zMin>gatheringAngles.zMax)&&<p role="alert" className="text-xs text-red-300">Each minimum must be no greater than its maximum.</p>}<p className="text-xs">Controls stop at the orientations required by the selected typology and letters. They update when the selection changes.</p></section>}
  {props.selectedCategory==="gathering"&&<section className="rounded border p-3 space-y-2" style={panel}><div className="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h3 className="text-sm font-semibold">Shared gathering operations</h3><button type="button" className="rounded border px-2 py-1 text-xs" style={button()} onClick={()=>{const roles=defaultGatheringBoundaryRoles(props.selectedTypology);rememberedRoles.current[props.selectedTypology]=roles;setGatheringOperations({...DEFAULT_GATHERING_OPERATIONS,boundaryRoles:roles});}}>Reset operations</button></div><p className="text-xs">Generate applies the chosen orientation, boundary roles, level targets and initial setbacks, then brings letters into direct intersection. Void-Field uses horizontal ascending layers; Contained Room stacks on a shared Z-axis. Rise and setback targets may tighten or shift to obtain contact; validation reports final deviations. Added floor plates, bridges, alcoves and blending remain disabled. Plate-only controls and controls overridden by the current stack are disabled below. Void-Field boundary roles are recorded while its faces remain horizontal. A requested opening can be omitted when it conflicts with the retained letters; a connected solid does not establish occupiable circulation.</p><div className="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2">{([['levelRise','Floor-to-floor rise (ft)',0,Infinity,.05],['staggerPercent',props.selectedTypology==='inserted-horizontal-plate'?'Stagger (% of plate depth)':'Stagger (% of letter width)',props.selectedTypology==='stepped-amphitheater'||props.selectedTypology==='linear-edge-gallery'?15:props.selectedTypology==='void-field-gathering'||props.selectedTypology==='inserted-horizontal-plate'?10:0,props.selectedTypology==='stepped-amphitheater'?40:props.selectedTypology==='void-field-gathering'?30:props.selectedTypology==='inserted-horizontal-plate'?25:props.selectedTypology==='linear-edge-gallery'?35:props.selectedTypology==='contained-room-within-volume'?15:100,5],['staggerDirection','Stagger direction (°)',-180,180,15],['boundaryRotation','Local boundary rotation (°)',-15,15,15],['alcoveDepthPercent','Alcove depth (% of bay)',props.selectedTypology==='stepped-amphitheater'?15:0,props.selectedTypology==='stepped-amphitheater'?35:100,5],['alcoveWidthPercent','Alcove width (% of bay)',1,100,5],['protectedVoidRadius','Protected void radius (ft)',0,Infinity,.05],['protectedVoidOffsetX','Void X offset from source center (ft)',-Infinity,Infinity,.05],['protectedVoidOffsetY','Void Y offset from source center (ft)',-Infinity,Infinity,.05],['minimumClearance','Minimum recess width (ft; floor plates off)',0,Infinity,.05]] as const).map(([key,label,min,max,step])=><label key={key} className="text-xs">{label}<input className="block w-full rounded border p-1" style={style} type="number" min={Number.isFinite(min)?min:undefined} max={Number.isFinite(max)?max:undefined} step={step} disabled={inactiveGatheringOperation(props.selectedTypology,key)} value={gatheringOperations[key]} onChange={e=>{const value=e.currentTarget.valueAsNumber;if(Number.isFinite(value))setGatheringOperations(previous=>({...previous,[key]:Math.max(min,Math.min(max,key==='boundaryRotation'?Math.round(value/step)*step:value))}));}}/></label>)}</div><div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">{(['L','U','V'] as const).map(letter=><label key={letter} className="text-xs">{letter} boundary role<select aria-label={letter+" boundary role"} className="block w-full rounded border p-1" style={style} value={gatheringOperations.boundaryRoles[letter]} onChange={e=>{const role=e.currentTarget.value as BoundaryRole;if(role===gatheringOperations.boundaryRoles[letter])return;const next={...gatheringOperations,boundaryRoles:{...gatheringOperations.boundaryRoles,[letter]:role}};rememberedRoles.current[props.selectedTypology]=next.boundaryRoles;setGatheringOperations(next);}}>{(['floor','wall','edge','enclosure','void'] as const).map(role=><option key={role} value={role}>{role==='void'?'void boundary':role}</option>)}</select></label>)}</div><p className="text-xs">Gathering letters are moved to intersect directly. Bridges and floor plates are off; circulation clearance is not verified.</p><p className="text-xs">Adjacent letters are brought into contact without added bridges.</p><p className="text-xs">A connected solid is checked; occupiable access, ramp slope and clearance around obstacles require further validation.</p></section>}
  {props.selectedCategory==="office"&&<section className="rounded border p-3" style={panel}><h3 className="text-sm font-semibold">Workspace ruleset</h3><p className="text-xs">The selected letters generate the office space through direct solid intersections. Open Hall uses L letters only: mirrored 90° pairs on YZ form walls along X, with matching pairs on XY; U and V are excluded. The office rules guide the initial layout; no preset slabs, bridges, ramps or supports are added. Levels may tighten to connect the letters. Validation measures the generated form and marks unmet or unchecked workspace rules as not verified.</p></section>}
